        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/thick-as-thieves-header.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>\nPerhaps you have fond memories of <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/deus-ex\">Deus Ex</a> designer Warren Spector's legendary stealth game Thief: A Dark Project, or perhaps your sneaker of choice is Arkane Studios' more recent immersive sim <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/dishonored\">Dishonored</a>. Either way, you might be intrigued to hear Spector's latest effort, Thick as Thieves - which has been reimagined as solo and co-op game following its original PvPvE reveal - is launching on 20th May.\n</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/thick-of-thieves-ditches-pvp-for-solo-and-co-op-as-may-release-revealed\">Read more</a></p>",
